h{font-weight:500}#rr-weekly-fixtures a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none}#rr-weekly-fixtures a:hover{text-decoration:underline}#rr-weekly-fixtures a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fff;outline-offset:4px}#rr-weekly-fixtures small{display:block;font-size:.75rem;color:#bec1ca;margin-top:5px}#rr-weekly-fixtures td strong{font-size:1.2rem;color:#ffaaaa;white-space:nowrap}.rr-fixture-note{font-size:.85rem;color:#bec1ca}</style>\n<div class=\"rr-sport\" id=\"rr-toppscorere\">\n<div class=\"rr-sport-intro\"><p class=\"rr-eyebrow\">LOKAL FOTBALL · SESONGEN 2026</p><h2>Hvem finner veien til mål?</h2><p>Følg målscorerne i Bremnes sin seniorfotball. Her finner du separate oversikter for herrer og damer.</p><p class=\"rr-sport-date\">Tall kontrollert <time datetime=\"2026-09-19\">19. september 2026</time> · Automatisk kontrollert</p><nav aria-label=\"Velg toppscorerliste\"><a class=\"rr-btn-outline\" href=\"#herrer\">Herrer ↓</a> <a class=\"rr-btn-outline\" href=\"#damer\">Damer ↓</a></nav></div>\n<div class=\"rr-sport-grid\"><section class=\"rr-sport-card\" id=\"herrer\" aria-labelledby=\"herrer-heading\"><p class=\"rr-eyebrow\">BREMNES · SENIOR</p><h2 id=\"herrer-heading\">Herrer</h2><p class=\"rr-sport-team\">Bremnes Menn Senior A</p><table><caption>Registrerte målscorere – herrer, 2026</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Plass</th><th scope=\"col\">Spiller</th><th scope=\"col\">Mål</th><th scope=\"col\">Kamper</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><th scope=\"row\"><a href=\"https://www.fotball.no/fotballdata/person/profil/?fiksId=2746542&amp;underside=statistikk\">Erlend Meling Nesse</a></th><td><strong>24</strong></td><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><th scope=\"row\"><a href=\"https://www.fotball.no/fotballdata/person/profil/?fiksId=4148611&amp;underside=statistikk\">Pavlo Buriak</a></th><td><strong>13</strong></td><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><th scope=\"row\"><a href=\"https://www.fotball.no/fotballdata/person/profil/?fiksId=3676816&amp;underside=statistikk\">Adrian Sø